---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
import Catalogue from "../studio/Catalogue";
---

<Site
  title="Firmware releases"
  description="Find published LightVM firmware for your board and compare its lighting, network and audio features."
>
  <section class="wrap page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">CHOOSE WHAT YOUR DEVICE CAN DO</p>
    <h1>Firmware releases</h1>
    <p class="intro">Find the software your board needs to run LightVM.</p>
    <p>
      Choose your board, then the features your project needs. For example, MQTT
      connects lights to Home Assistant; audio subscriptions let a board receive
      sound measurements from an analyser. Each build includes a particular set
      of features, called a profile. You can review the details before deciding
      what to install.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="wrap section compact">
    <Catalogue client:load />
  </section>
</Site>
